wk says that offer one must be  planning to capture deku alive  because they are yet to reach the point  where they can just steal one for all by  force  and with dr ujiko in custody and all of  his facilities shut down  it is unlikely that all for one would be  able to preserve deku's body  if he actually killed him so capturing  deku alive appears to be the only  feasible  option this probably explains why the  pro heroes agreed to have deku service  bait  because they're confident that he won't  be killed hawks then says that for most  of the skps from tartarus  capturing deku would be an impossible  task except for one  according to hawks if that woman is  involved  then it's a different story hawks  reveals that the woman he is referring  to  is his former senpai meaning his senior  and that the manhunt for her has been a  top priority for the heroes  in fact hawkes tells deku in no  uncertain terms that if he ever comes  face to face with  this woman he has to do everything he  can to run away  and then back in the present deku  confirms that the female villain who  just shot his secret transmission device  is the same woman that hawks was talking  about she is a former pro hero  affiliated with the hero public safety  commission  and her name is lady nagant whoa  so much information was just revealed in  only a few  panels this female villain that we've  all been wondering about  is not just some ordinary villain she is  a former pro hero who betrayed  the hero society she is also hawks's  former senpai  meaning that he probably worked with her  as part of the hero public safety  commission  and she is considered to be so strong  and so dangerous that even deku with the  power of one for all  must not attempt to fight her instead if  he ever comes across her he must run  away  as soon as possible by the way the name  lady nagant will make sense once we  discuss her quirk which is also revealed  in this chapter but more on that  later deku decides to take hawks's  advice and he attempts to run away from  lady nagant  but that is easier said than done and  now that deku's secret transmission  device was destroyed he can't contact  hawks and the others and tell them that  he is currently fighting  lady nagant so there is no guarantee  that some sort of backup  will arrive in time to help deku deku  attempts to retreat but that is  effectively blocked by lady nagan's  extremely accurate  sniping and at that point both  combatants are forced to acknowledge  each other's phenomenal abilities deku  recognizes that lady nagan's shooting is  on a whole other level  while lady nagant acknowledges that deku  is an absolute  mad lad in fact deku is the only person  who was able to deflect  two of her bullets which again  emphasizes that a regular hero stands  absolutely no  chance against this woman we then get to  see an old interview that pro hero snipe  did  some time ago in this interview snipe  who is known for his outstanding  shooting skills like that's his whole  thing  reveals that he is still the only second  best long distance sniper  in japan that is because his homing  quirk cannot compare to the shooting  skills  of lady nagant who by the way has an  insane range of 3 kilometers which is  like 5 times bigger than the range of  snipe  lady nagant possesses a quirk called  rifle  and with this quirk she is able to  produce a rifle from her right arm  as we saw in the previous chapter but  her quirk has another incredible ability  that we did not know about  until now she can actually mix and mold  her hair like  putty and then harden it in order to  create  specialized bullets bullets which she  can then fire through the rifle  her ability to completely control the  shape and structure of her bullets  allows her to produce results that the  other snipers cannot  even dream of that is why lady nagant is  known  as the human rifle and back when she was  a hero  all of the other pro heroes with long  range quirks were jealous  of her unbelievable skill and precision  back in the present deku is struggling  to deal with lady nagan's shooting  she has insanely accurate aim and she  can even shoot rapid-fire shots  so outrunning her seems to be an  impossible task  deku admits to himself that if he didn't  have danger since he would have been  defeated  a long time ago deku also concludes that  he won't be able to escape the villain's  range  at this rate right now he is only about  one kilometer away from her  and her range is three kilometers so  instead of running away deku decides to  get  closer to lady nagant after all snipers  are experts at long range combat  so if deku can get closer to her maybe  he can throw her  off and take away her biggest advantage  meanwhile  overhaul is still sitting on the rooftop  and listening to black  parade he calls out for the old man  again his old yakuza boss  and lady nagan tells him sure sure we'll  go see the old man  after this mission is over she wonders  if maybe she should have just left  overhaul behind back in tartarus  but she decided to bring him along  because she thought that he might be  useful  it is not revealed how exactly she was  expecting him to be useful  but i assume it's either related to his  quirk or to his knowledge  about the quirk cancelling bullets we  then get a flashback to the moment when  lady nagant and overhaul escaped from  tartarus  at one point she came face to face with  all for one  and he called her the traitor hero the  beautiful  lady nagant clearly all for one is a man  of culture as well  in fact all for one considers lady  nagant to be a league above  everyone else which is exactly how hawks  sees her as well  and because of this all for one asks  lady nagant to do him a very  important favor all for one foresaw that  deku will leave the ua  and start acting independently and he  asks lady nagant to capture deku  and bring him back to all for one at  first lady nagant has no interest in  this mission she just wants to get out  of tartarus and regain her freedom  but all for one reminds her that she has  already slaughtered  many of her fellow heroes but all of  that will be in vain  if she doesn't help him now according to  all for one  the fall of the pro-hero society that  she is hoping for  will never happen as long as deku lives  from this brief exchange it is clear  that lady nagant  really hates the pro-hero society  although it is not yet clear  why she feels that way but all for one  clearly knows how she feels  and he manages to convince her to make a  deal with him by straight up giving her  a new quirk  called airwalk airwalk is a quirk that  all for one had used before  and just like the name suggests it  allows its user to levitate  or walk on air suddenly back in the  present  lady nagant leaps into the air and vows  to carry on her mission to capture  deku and that is how this insane  chapter ends personally i loved this  chapter and i love that so many of our  questions about this new villain were  answered although to be fair  this chapter also raised a bunch of new  and very interesting questions about her  why did she betray the hero society and  why does she hate it  so much there has to be some deeply  personal reason  for this hatred and i bet her backstory  is going to be  really really interesting her name  appears to come from an old  russian rifle called the mossin nagant  this rifle was used by the russian army  against the japanese during the  russo-japanese war that took place  between 1904  and 1905 so maybe that's how horikoshi  came up with the name  i am definitely not an expert on rifles  so i have no idea how popular this rifle  is today  or how well known it is in japan but  it's an interesting choice of name  nonetheless now here are the big  questions that i have  after this chapter other than lady  nagan's backstory and why she betrayed  the hero society  i am also wondering what she wants with  overhaul  does she just want to use his quirk or  does she want to know more about the  quirk canceling bullets  or is there more to it than that and  while we're  on the topic of overhaul's quirk why  didn't all for one just steal it  back in tartarus all for one clearly  knew who overhaul was  and that means that he very likely knew  that overhaul's quirk could have healed  shigaraki  almost instantly so why wouldn't he just  steal the quirk  to heal shigaraki is this a plot  oversight by horikoshi  or is something else going on here also  could lady nagan to be connected to the  ua  traitor in some way i'm not sure for how  long she's actually been in tartarus  like has she been there for years  or was she only arrested recently but if  hypothetically her treason was only  discovered  in recent months then she could  theoretically be the ua trader herself  now no she's not a ua student or teacher  but through her role in the hero public  safety commission  she may have had access to sensitive  information about the ua  information that she might have passed  on to the villains for a price  i might be reaching here because i  really want the ua trader thing to  actually be resolved but you never know  finally and most importantly why is lady  nagant  so hot i can't quite pinpoint it but i  think it has a lot to do with her big  beautiful lats she is clearly in great  shape and who doesn't love a woman with  killer lats  but that is enough simping for today if  you enjoyed this video and you want to  see more videos like it  please leave that like to let me know it  really does help  and if you're new to anime outpour or  maybe watch our videos but you haven't  subscribed yet  do me a favor and make this the video  that you subscribe  and hit that notification bell to turn  on all  notifications you really have to go  through the trouble of subscribing  hitting that bell and then selecting the  option that says all  if you don't do that you're still going  to miss a ton of our videos even i