ous  of her unbelievable skill and precision  back in the present deku is struggling  to deal with lady nagan's shooting  she has insanely accurate aim and she  can even shoot rapid-fire shots  so outrunning her seems to be an  impossible task  deku admits to himself that if he didn't  have danger since he would have been  defeated  a long time ago deku also concludes that  he won't be able to escape the villain's  range  at this rate right now he is only about  one kilometer away from her  and her range is three kilometers so  instead of running away deku decides to  get  closer to lady nagant after all snipers  are experts at long range combat  so if deku can get closer to her maybe  he can throw her  off and take away her biggest advantage  meanwhile  overhaul is still sitting on the rooftop  and listening to black  parade he calls out for the old man  again his old yakuza boss  and lady nagan tells him sure sure we'll  go see the old man  after this mission is over she wonders  if maybe she should have just left  overhaul behind back in tartarus  but she decided to bring him along  because she thought that he might be  useful  it is not revealed how exactly she was  expecting him to be useful  but i assume it's either related to his  quirk or to his knowledge  about the quirk cancelling bullets we  then get a flashback to the moment when  lady nagant and overhaul escaped from  tartarus  at one point she came face to face with  all for one  and he called her the traitor hero the  beautiful  lady nagant clearly all for one is a man  of culture as well  in fact all for one considers lady  nagant to be a league above  everyone else which is exactly how hawks  sees her as well  and because of this all for one asks  lady nagant to do him a very  important favor all for one foresaw that  deku will leave the ua  and start acting independently and he  asks lady nagant to capture deku  and bring him back to all for one at  first lady nagant has no interest in  this mission she just wants to get out  of tartarus and regain her freedom  but all for one reminds her that she has  already slaughtered  many of her fellow heroes but all of  that will be in vain  if she doesn't help him now according to  all for one  the fall of the pro-hero society that  she is hoping for  will never happen as long as deku lives  from this brief exchange it is clear  that lady nagant  really hates the pro-hero society  although it is not yet clear  why she feels that way but all for one  clearly knows how she feels  and he manages to convince her to make a  deal with him by straight up giving her  a new quirk  called airwalk airwalk is a quirk that  all for one had used before  and just like the name suggests it  allows its user to levitate  or walk on air suddenly back in the  present  lady nagant leaps into the air and vows  to carry on her mission to capture  deku and that is how this insane  chapter ends personally i loved this  chapter and i love that so many of our  questions about this new villain were  answered although to be fair  this chapter also raised a bunch of new  and very interesting questions about her  why did she betray the hero society and  why does she hate it  so much there has to be some deeply  personal reason  for this hatred and i bet her backstory  is going to be  really really interesting her name  appears to come from an old  russian rifle called the mossin nagant  this rifle was used by the russian army  against the japanese during the  russo-japanese war that took place  between 1904  and 1905 so maybe that's how horikoshi  came up with the name  i am definitely not an expert on rifles  so i have no idea how popular this rifle  is today  or how well known it is in japan but  it's an interesting choice of name  nonetheless now here are the big  questions that i have  after this chapter other than lady  nagan's backstory and why she betrayed  the hero society  i am also wondering what she wants with  overhaul  does she just want to use his quirk or  does she want to know more about the  quirk canceling bullets  or is there more to it than that and  while we're  on the topic of overhaul's quirk why  didn't all for one just steal it  back in tartarus all for one clearly  knew who overhaul was  and that means that he very likely knew  that overhaul's quirk could have healed  shigaraki  almost instantly so why wouldn't he just  steal the quirk  to heal shigaraki is this a plot  oversight by horikoshi  or is something else going on here also  could lady nagan to be connected to the  ua  traitor in some way i'm not sure for how  long she's actually been in tartarus  like has she been there for years  or was she only arrested recently but if  hypothetically her treason was only  discovered  in recent months then she could  theoretically be the ua trader herself  now no she's not a ua student or teacher  but through her role in the hero public  safety commission  she may have had access to sensitive  information about the ua  information that she might have passed  on to the villains for a price  i might be reaching here because i  really want the ua trader thing to  actually be resolved but you never know  finally and most importantly why is lady  nagant  so hot i can't quite pinpoint it but i  think it has a lot to do with her big  beautiful lats she is clearly in great  shape and who doesn't love a woman with  killer lats  but that is enough simping for today if  you enjoyed this video and you want to  see more videos like it  please leave that like to let me know it  really does help  and if you're new to anime outpour or  maybe watch our videos but you haven't  subscribed yet  do me a favor and make this the video  that you subscribe  and hit that notification bell to turn  on all  notifications you really have to go  through the trouble of subscribing  hitting that bell and then selecting the  option that says all  if you don't do that you're still going  to miss a ton of our videos even if you  are subscribed  it's just how youtube works you can also  hit me up on twitter  and instagram at anime uproar  a big thank you to all of our anime  opera patrons for making videos like  this one possible  special thank you to alpha sigma red  haired raven  and av these guys are absolute  mad lads and disciples of lord twego  himself and i can't forget all of our  the one  tier patrons the ones who rise above all  other clans  including ingrata pate heffa algertol  dr cortman the toasted qi bang emperor  otaku spidey life canal tungsten targus  baked buddhist and you know finally  thank you also to our pro hero tier  patrons including the one and only  gilgamesh steelers  angel crews anatoly kazatsky cricket xp  rathu indiora very gucci alicia octor  bonnie parks hinokamian water joy and  garcia ted no ted isparky65 jessica  lafond metal mama  corey mcgowan fat boy games deadly saint  soul ray slice and dice and pillow if  you enjoy our videos and you feel that  they provide value for you  consider supporting us on patreon even a  single dollar will give you access to  our patron exclusive discord  and your name will appear in our videos  along with these  legendary people as always thank you  guys so much for watching  and until next time see ya space cowboys  [Music]  you


